# FreeBASIC: FreeBASIC manual (keywords and language reference); requirements/languages/freebasic.md
name     freebasic fb bas
keyword  Dim As Integer Long Single Double String Boolean Function Sub End If Then Else ElseIf For To Step
keyword  Next Do Loop While Until Wend Select Case Return Exit Type Declare Const Shared Print Input
keyword  And Or Not Mod Namespace Using ByVal ByRef Static
builtin  True False Len Mid Left Right Str Val Chr Asc Sleep
fold-case
line-comment   ' REM
block-comment  /' '/
string   " "  : doubled
operators  +-*/\^=<>&
calls
